 184       +/*******************************************************************************/
 185       +/*  SAS Program: 02_data_cleaning.sas                                        */
 186       +/*  Purpose: Clean and transform the HOME_EQUITY dataset                     */
 187       +/*  - Create derived columns (LTV, LOAN_OUTCOME)                            */
