 327       +/*******************************************************************************/
 328       +/*  SAS Program: 04_risk_segmentation.sas                                    */
 329       +/*  Purpose: Create risk segments for loan portfolio analysis                */
 330       +/*  - Define risk buckets using PROC FORMAT                                  */
